are enlisted as under :
(i) There must be deception i.e that the accused must have deceived someone ;
(ii) That by the said deception, the accused must have induced a person:
(a) To deliver any property ; or (b) To make, alter or destroy the whole or the part or the valuable security or anything which is signed or sealed and which is capable of being converted into a valuable property;
(iii) The accused did so dishonestly.
